        card("Presentation 1A: a transcript of a voice message about a family member who is ill", "", examples=passage(_VM)),
        card("Culture note: folk healers and health centers", "Many rural areas in the Philippines suffer from an acute lack of modern medical services. There are instances in which people die without even seeing a doctor. Because the medical needs are so enormous and treatment is so expensive, reliance on folk healers and native shamans is still popular. Hence the albularyo, mantatawas, hilot and manghihilot thrive everywhere. They charge low fees or no fees at all. Health centers are the most common type of medical facility in rural areas; most of them, however, have no doctors or nurses and may lack sufficient medical supplies."),
