        card("Activity 3: seasonal ailments", "Write down seasonal ailments you had in the past twelve months and the treatment you received, then exchange the information with three classmates. The book’s guide dialog: A: Ano’ng nangyari sa iyo nitong nakaraang labindalawang buwan? B: Namaga ang tonsil ko. A: Ano’ng ginawa mo? B: Nagmumog lang ako ng suka. (a classroom activity, left out)."),
