        card("Activity 12: role play, home remedies with a host family", "You are an exchange student staying with a Filipino host family and curious about home remedies Filipinos use to cure common illnesses, including home remedies for skin diseases such as ringworm, tinea versicolor and athlete’s foot, sore throat, and cough and cold. Your partner plays the host family (open role play, left out)."),
        card("Activity 13: challenge yourself", "Share your experience or a friend’s experience with a common illness, including the symptoms and any home remedies or other medical intervention (open task, left out)."),
        card("Glossary", "", tables=[ttable(_GL)]),
